    "name": {
      "zh": "Nokia 8110",
      "en": "Nokia 8110"
    },
    "intro": {
      "zh": "Nokia 8110 是诺基亚 1996 年推出的弧形滑盖功能机，因「香蕉机」外号与《黑客帝国》出镜成为流行文化符号，是 GSM 短信时代最富辨识度的手机之一。",
      "en": "The Nokia 8110, launched in 1996, became a pop-culture icon with its curved slider 'banana' design and its cameo in The Matrix, one of the most recognizable phones of the GSM era."
    },
    "spec_version": "0.2",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine_min_version": "0.1.0",
    "precision_level": "L2",
    "era": 1996,
    "manufacturer": "Nokia",
    "category": "phone",
    "description": "Nokia 8110（1996），GSM 2G 数字功能机：弧形滑盖「香蕉机」、单色 LCD（需核实）、SMS 短信、滑盖接听、《黑客帝国》出镜。演示向（无成熟模拟器，固件红线）。",
